  { number := 256, text := "2. Lean 4, Idris 2, CompCert, and Rust are cited by [0002_Systems_Lean.md](0002_Systems_Lean.md) as Form 1 pins of the Systems Lean product tree, not of this specifications repository's `ref/`. This document does not move those pins here." },
