  { number := 294, text := "" },
  { number := 295, text := "First publication of this specification text. Defines beastdb as specification 0003 with file name `0003_beastdb.md` and lowercase product name beastdb; names libbeastdb as the freestanding product library; requires Systems Lean, a bootstrapped Slake that fully typechecks, and CompCert verified compilation as in `0002_Systems_Lean.md`; requires proven ACID, tries that do not use locks, SWMR, optional access by more than one writer on disjoint leaves, and fencing by generation; requires mmap, SIMD, zerocopy, LanguageID, WordID, and a representable Rosetta mapping; requires mandatory schema with predefined and inferred modes and proven migrations; requires access by ordered keys and values, time series access, and vector access with interoperability through fargo rather than a traditional foreign function interface; requires libbeastdb as the durable store target for later high assurance components including the Smart Symbolic Supercompiler; and limits this specification to a store that is local first." },
